---
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const isZh = lang !== 'en';
---
<div class="calc-primer" data-calc-primer data-lang={isZh ? 'zh' : 'en'}>
  <div class="calc-head">
    <div>
      <strong>{isZh ? '從偏微分到 JVP｜零基礎互動解釋' : 'From partial derivatives to JVP | beginner interactive'}</strong>
      <p>{isZh ? '把 MeanFlow 中 du/dt 拆成你熟悉的「某個量如何隨輸入改變」。' : 'Decompose the MeanFlow total derivative into ordinary changes with respect to each input.'}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-tabs" role="group" aria-label={isZh ? '微積分概念切換' : 'Calculus concept tabs'}>
      <button class="active" data-step="0">1</button><button data-step="1">2</button><button data-step="2">3</button><button data-step="3">4</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section data-panel="0">
    <span class="eyebrow">{isZh ? 'Ordinary derivative' : 'Ordinary derivative'}</span>
    <h3>{isZh ? '只有一個輸入時：導數就是斜率' : 'With one input, a derivative is a slope'}</h3>
    <code>f(x)=x²  →  df/dx=2x</code>
    <p>{isZh ? '把 x 稍微增加一點，f 會增加多少？導數回答的就是這件事。' : 'If x moves a tiny amount, how much does f move? That is what the derivative measures.'}</p>
  </section>

  <section data-panel="1" hidden>
    <span class="eyebrow">{isZh ? 'Partial derivative' : 'Partial derivative'}</span>
    <h3>{isZh ? '有多個輸入時：一次只看一個方向' : 'With multiple inputs, vary one input at a time'}</h3>
    <code>u(z,t)=z²+2t</code>
    <div class="formula-grid"><div><b>∂u/∂z = 2z</b><small>{isZh ? '固定 t，只看 z 的影響' : 'hold t fixed; vary z'}</small></div><div><b>∂u/∂t = 2</b><small>{isZh ? '固定 z，只看 t 的影響' : 'hold z fixed; vary t'}</small></div></div>
    <p>{isZh ? '偏微分不是新的神祕運算；只是「其他輸入先不動，單獨問某一個輸入造成多少變化」。' : 'A partial derivative simply asks how one input changes the output while the others are held fixed.'}</p>
  </section>

  <section data-panel="2" hidden>
    <span class="eyebrow">{isZh ? 'Total derivative' : 'Total derivative'}</span>
    <h3>{isZh ? '如果 z 本身也隨 t 移動，就要把兩種變化加起來' : 'If z also moves with t, combine both sources of change'}</h3>
    <code>du/dt = (∂u/∂z)(dz/dt) + ∂u/∂t</code>
    <p>{isZh ? 'MeanFlow 中 dz/dt=v，所以變成 du/dt=(∂u/∂z)v+∂u/∂t。第一項是「state 移動造成的變化」，第二項是「time 本身造成的變化」。' : 'In MeanFlow, dz/dt=v, giving du/dt=(∂u/∂z)v+∂u/∂t. The first term comes from state motion; the second from time itself.'}</p>
  </section>

  <section data-panel="3" hidden>
    <span class="eyebrow">JVP</span>
    <h3>{isZh ? 'JVP 只是一次算出「沿某個方向走時，輸出怎麼變」' : 'A JVP computes how the output changes along one direction'}</h3>
    <div class="toy-controls">
      <label>z <input data-z type="range" min="-2" max="2" step="0.1" value="1"/><output data-zout>1.0</output></label>
      <label>v=dz/dt <input data-v type="range" min="-2" max="2" step="0.1" value="0.5"/><output data-vout>0.5</output></label>
    </div>
    <code data-eq>u=z²+2t → JVP=[2z,2]·[v,1] = 3.0</code>
    <p>{isZh ? '在完整 MeanFlow 輸入 (z,r,t) 中，r 固定，所以 tangent 是 [v,0,1]。因此 JVP(u;v)=J_u·[v,0,1]=∂_z u·v+∂_t u。' : 'For the full MeanFlow input (z,r,t), r is held fixed, so the tangent is [v,0,1]. Thus JVP(u;v)=J_u·[v,0,1]=∂_z u·v+∂_t u.'}</p>
    <div class="important">{isZh ? 'JVP 不需要把完整 Jacobian 矩陣存出來；它直接算 Jacobian × vector。這就是它在高維 neural network 中實用的原因。' : 'A JVP does not require materializing the full Jacobian; it directly computes Jacobian × vector, which is why it is practical for high-dimensional neural networks.'}</div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
.calc-primer{border:1px solid var(--rh-border);border-radius:1rem;padding:1rem;margin:1.1rem 0;background:var(--rh-surface-2)}.calc-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.calc-head p{margin:.25rem 0 0;color:var(--rh-muted)}.calc-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,2.6rem);gap:.4rem}.calc-tabs button{height:2.4rem;border:1px solid var(--rh-border);border-radius:.55rem;background:var(--rh-surface);color:var(--rh-coffee);cursor:pointer}.calc-tabs button.active{background:var(--rh-coffee);color:#fff;border-color:var(--rh-coffee)}.calc-primer section{margin-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--rh-border);padding-top:1rem;min-height:13rem}.calc-primer h3{margin:.3rem 0 .8rem}.calc-primer code{display:block;padding:.8rem;border-radius:.65rem;background:var(--rh-surface);border:1px solid var(--rh-border);font-size:1rem;white-space:normal}.eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--rh-caramel);font-weight:700}.formula-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7rem;margin:.8rem 0}.formula-grid>div{padding:.75rem;border:1px solid var(--rh-border);border-radius:.65rem;background:var(--rh-surface)}.formula-grid small{display:block;color:var(--rh-muted);margin-top:.25rem}.toy-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem;margin:.7rem 0}.toy-controls label{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}.important{border-left:3px solid var(--rh-caramel);padding:.7rem .8rem;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rh-caramel) 8%,transparent);border-radius:.4rem;margin-top:.8rem}.calc-primer p{color:var(--rh-muted);line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:720px){.calc-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.calc-tabs{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.formula-grid,.toy-controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<script>
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll('[data-calc-primer]')){if(root.dataset.ready)continue;root.dataset.ready='1';const tabs=[...root.querySelectorAll('[data-step]')],panels=[...root.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]')];function setStep(n){tabs.forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle('active',i===n));panels.forEach((p,i)=>p.hidden=i!==n)}tabs.forEach((b,i)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>setStep(i)));const z=root.querySelector('[data-z]'),v=root.querySelector('[data-v]'),zo=root.querySelector('[data-zout]'),vo=root.querySelector('[data-vout]'),eq=root.querySelector('[data-eq]');function update(){if(!z||!v)return;const zz=Number(z.value),vv=Number(v.value),j=2*zz*vv+2;zo.textContent=zz.toFixed(1);vo.textContent=vv.toFixed(1);eq.textContent=`u=z²+2t → JVP=[2z,2]·[v,1] = ${j.toFixed(2)}`}z?.addEventListener('input',update);v?.addEventListener('input',update);update()}
</script>
